step 24 "text"
out b "-=======- Entering APPEND Mode -========-\n\r    Type .h on a new line for help\n\r Terminate with a ~ or @ on a blank line.\n\r-=======================================-\n\r 1. Syntax: qmconfig [show|ansiprompt|ansicolor|telnetga] [on|off]\n\r 2. \n\r 3.         This command is used to set options developed in the\n\r 4.         QuickMUD source. They include:\n\r 5. \n\r 6.         ansicolor  - do new logins have color on by default?\n\r 7.         ansiprompt - do new logins see a \"color?\" prompt?\n\r 8.         show       - show current settings of qmconfig variables\n\r 9.         telnetga   - do new logins have telnetga enabled?\n\r> "
rng 51929 534cb46e
